        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Infernal Contract always takes its turn first in initiative order and cannot be directly damaged. A creature adjacent to the Infernal Contract can attempt to use the Litigation Larceny action. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>The Infernal Contract has one action per turn that it can use only to Fly towards a creature that is in control of the contract or to Fly away from a creature that has attempted @UUID[Compendium.covalon.verndhelt-items.Item.k9t36ZqXDVWCQfwO]{Litigation Larceny} in the last round. </p>"
        },
